OL,3,GYorkshire & Humber
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FA cloudy
OL,6,Fstart to the night, with any mixed
OL,7,Frain and snow confined to high ground.
OL,8,FBreaks in the cloud developing towards
OL,9,Fdawn will allow frost to form in
OL,10,Fplaces. A generally cold feel to the
OL,11,Fnight.
OL,12,
OL,13,CWednesday:FA dry day, with cloudy
OL,14,Fperiods during the morning. Breaks in
OL,15,Fthe cloud developing through the
OL,16,Fafternoon, with a brisk southeasterly
OL,17,Fbreeze along the coast.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
