OL,3,GYorkshire & Humber
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Thursday to Saturday:
OL,6,FTurning increasingly cloudy on
OL,7,FThursday, but remaining dry. A wet
OL,8,Fstart to Friday, with rain, or snow
OL,9,Fover high ground, clearing. Outbreaks
OL,10,Fof rain on Saturday. Temperatures
OL,11,Fgenerally below average.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
